019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2019 Q1","e":"ego","d":"2019-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"George Burns","x":"We maintained our guidance of 390,000 to 420,000 ounces of gold, at cash costs of $550 to $600 per ounce for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2019 Q3","e":"ego","d":"2019-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"George Burns","x":"Consolidated gold production and costs came in on plan and we reiterated our 2019 guidance of 390,000 ounces to 420,000 ounces of gold at cash costs of $550 per ounce to $600 per ounce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2019 Q3","e":"ego","d":"2019-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Philip Yee","x":"So, I think we're still -- as we keep saying, we are maintaining guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q1","e":"ego","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dennis Dick","x":"We have seen a reduction in our workforce of approximately 25% as some workers, who are considered to be high-risk to COVID-19, have been asked to stay at home as a precaution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q1","e":"ego","d":"2020-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"George Raymond Burns","x":"At this time, we are maintaining guidance of for 2020 of 520,000 to 550,000 ounces of gold at an all-in sustaining cost of $850 to $950 per ounce sold.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q1","e":"ego","d":"2020-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dennis Dick","x":"Looking forward, we are maintaining our 2020 guidance at this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q2","e":"ego","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dick","x":"Last quarter, we talked a bit about a reduced workforce due to some workers being considered high risk for COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q2","e":"ego","d":"2020-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"George Burns","x":"We continue to make progress in delivering value for our stakeholders as demonstrated by our strong quarterly production and maintaining guidance despite COVID-19 operational challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q2","e":"ego","d":"2020-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dick","x":"Looking forward, we are maintaining our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q3","e":"ego","d":"2020-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Dick","x":"Looking forward, we are maintaining our 2020 guidance but expect to be at the lower end of the production range, a significant accomplishment given the 2020 operating environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q4","e":"ego","d":"2021-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jason Cho","x":"I'd say streaming has a place in terms of how we're looking at all the alternatives related to funding Skouries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/eldorado-gold-corp-ego-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EGO 2020 Q4","e":"ego","d":"2021-02-26","